        <detaileddescription>
<para>Signature: <computeroutput>std::size_t fn(<ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_ada_lora_t_t_export" kindref="compound">AdaLoraTTExport</ref>&amp; exp, double eps)</computeroutput>.</para>
