        <briefdescription>
<para>Apply TT-rounding (globally optimal rank cut) to an exported adapter. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>TT-rounding minimises ‖ΔW - ΔW_approx‖_F for a given ε budget, making it globally optimal vs. AdaLoRA&apos;s greedy singular-value pruning.</para>
<para>After rounding, the new <computeroutput>active_rank</computeroutput> per layer is set to the number of kept singular values and can be fed back to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_ada_lo_r_a_adapter_1ac465cf7df8431af11204ce071e33c6dd" kindref="member">AdaLoRAAdapter::reallocateRanks()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
